
// Beat names resolve lexically from their position, order-independent:
// a nested beat is visible in its whole scope (even before its
// declaration line) and shadows a same-named top-level beat.

beat Main
  beat("Report")

  beat Report
    Nested report.

  beat("Report")
  -> beat("Report")

beat Report
  Top level report.

/*
<test>
- expected: |
    ~ Nested report.

    ~ Nested report.

    ~ Nested report.
</test>
*/
